  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Genuine leather with fuzzy suede overlays\nLow-profile design for sleek style\nPadded, low-cut collar\nMetallic gold Mini Swoosh emblem placed between heel and quarter for distinctive style\nLightweight cushioned midsole for reinforced relief\nPerforations at toebox for increased ventilation\nRubber outsole with classic hoops pivot circle for guaranteed grip on all surfaces\nLace closure secures the fit\nThe Nike Dunk Low Mini Swoosh is imported.\nWith the retro trend at full stride, these Women's Nike Dunk Low Mini Swoosh Casual Shoes make a timely arrival. This exclusive edition of the cherished class, crafted from a genuine leather upper with fuzzy suede overlays, retains all of the OG design lines while adding a golden Mini Swoosh emblem for a contemporary touch with vintage charm.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's Nike Dunk Low Mini Swoosh Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Adult</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Light British Tan/Cream II/White/Light British Tan</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>3835510</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">Nike Size Guide &amp; Conversions (Adult - Women's)</summary>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Official Nike footwear size conversion matrix (US / UK / EU):</p>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5;\">\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">US Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">UK Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">EU Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">Availability</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 5.0</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 2.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 35.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 5.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 3</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 36</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 6.0</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 3.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 36.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 6.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 4</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 37.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 7.0</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK